.TH "lectos\-tui" "1" "2026\-10\-13" "lectos 0.1.0" "General Commands Manual"
.PP
.SH NAME
.PP
lectos\-tui \- terminal presenter console for PDF slides
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBlectos\-tui\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIPDF\fR|\fIFOLDER\fR [\fINOTES\fR]
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBlectos\-tui\fR is \fBlectos \-\-console tui\fR with \fB\-\-projector zathura\fR as the default.\& It needs no GTK: the console is a
standard\-library terminal interface (notes as styled text, slide previews through \fBpdftoppm\fR and \fBchafa\fR, Unicode
approximations of math) and the audience sees a Zathura window.\&
.PP
It takes the same options as \fBlectos\fR(1), which also describes the keys and the options file.\& Ink, chalkboard and
blackout are available only with \fB\-\-projector gtk\fR; the laser pointer needs the GTK console.\&
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBlectos\fR(1)
.PP
